      "prompt": "Create exactly 15 distinct full-body Accu DUNK-SCYTHE poses in 5 columns by 3 rows, row-major. Accu matches reference: young human woman, warm tan skin, green eyes, blunt black bangs, sides clipped short, twin long black ponytails with teal ties, black sleeveless uniform with teal/violet trim, black sleeves/tights, teal-violet sneakers. Maintain face, hair, kit and anatomy. A right-facing scythe-style dunk: approach, gather, takeoff tick4, rise with knees tucked; sweep right arm in a broad horizontal arc across body; rotate shoulders through deep side-to-side swing; arm circles around head like a scythe; at peak tick14 extend toward far side of imaginary rim; re-cock and finish in a downward scything release at tick21, follow-through tick23; descend, land, recover. 15 distinct connected poses. Hands empty, all limbs and feet visible in every cell. Game draws ball separately. No basketball, sphere, prop/object, hoop/rim, other athlete, court, floor, shadow, text, number, logo, grid lines, effects or background. Blank uniform. True RGBA transparent background, no checkerboard; crisp outlined 1990s pixel art. Return only sheet.",
